---
import { Image } from "@/components/starwind/image";
---

<section class="@container mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-24">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-8 @lg:flex-row @lg:items-start">
    <Image
      src="/images/intro.webp"
      alt="A Wild Pear student outdoors"
      width={166}
      height={221}
      class="w-full max-w-xs rounded-2xl @lg:shrink-0"
    />
    <div class="@lg:pt-2">
      <h2>Welcome to Wild Pear!</h2>
      <div class="text-muted-foreground mt-4 space-y-4 text-pretty">
        <p>
          We are currently enrolling, navigate to our{" "}
          <a
            href="/enrollment-information"
            class="text-primary-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:no-underline"
          >
            enrollment tab
          </a>{" "}
          for more info. At our school we get our hands dirty, we jump in puddles, we tell
          stories, we create things that have never existed, we cook and eat delicious food, we
          share and support feelings (even the big hard ones), we explore tirelessly, sing
          enthusiastically, and try new things everyday. Most of all, we want to be together, and
          we'd like to be with you too.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you are interested in enrolling your child, please look through the rest of our
          website to see if our school feels like a good fit for your family. Waitlist and
          touring information can be found in the{" "}
          <a
            href="/enrollment-information"
            class="text-primary-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:no-underline"
          >
            enrollment tab
          </a>
          . Thank you!
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
